garden
Garden medians provide several decorative and climate-appropriate plant, mulch and
pavement combinations. They are typically notable features in the public right of way and
may mark gateways into special districts or activity centers. The planting palettes range in cost
and complexity, and are formal or informal in character.  Advantages of this style include:
(1) creation or reinforcement of a district identity; and (2) the ability to add/ subtract planting
quantities and mix different pavement types.
